{"boardId": 415, "boardDict": {"SYMBOLISM": [{"question": {"id": 138101, "air_date": "2001-09-12", "answer": "donkey", "category": "SYMBOLISM", "daily_double": false, "round": "Jeopardy!", "text": "'This animal, the symbol of a major political party, is a symbol of stubbornness'", "valid_links": [], "value": 100}, "alive": true, "id": 11708}, {"question": {"id": 138107, "air_date": "2001-09-12", "answer": "Spring", "category": "SYMBOLISM", "daily_double": false, "round": "Jeopardy!", "text": "'Autumn can symbolize a waning life & this season can symbolize new beginnings or birth'", "valid_links": [], "value": 200}, "alive": true, "id": 11709}, {"question": {"id": 138113, "air_date": "2001-09-12", "answer": "the caged bird", "category": "SYMBOLISM", "daily_double": false, "round": "Jeopardy!", "text": "'It symbolizes imprisonment & Maya Angelou knows \"why\" it \"sings\"'", "valid_links": [], "value": 300}, "alive": true, "id": 11710}, {"question": {"id": 138119, "air_date": "2001-09-12", "answer": "shadows", "category": "SYMBOLISM", "daily_double": false, "round": "Jeopardy!", "text": "'Symbols of mystery, they're the mysterious doubles of the people who cast them'", "valid_links": [], "value": 400}, "alive": true, "id": 11711}, {"question": {"id": 138124, "air_date": "2001-09-12", "answer": "Chastity", "category": "SYMBOLISM", "daily_double": false, "round": "Jeopardy!", "text": "'As a sapphire is a symbol of this, Cher could have called her daughter Sapphire instead of the name she chose'", "valid_links": [], "value": 500}, "alive": true, "id": 11712}], "IT'S EASY": [{"question": {"id": 77001, "air_date": "1999-11-05", "answer": "a log", "category": "IT'S EASY", "daily_double": false, "round": "Jeopardy!", "text": "'Even if you're not a lumberjack, things can be as easy as falling off one of these'", "valid_links": [], "value": 100}, "alive": true, "id": 11718}, {"question": {"id": 77007, "air_date": "1999-11-05", "answer": "cake", "category": "IT'S EASY", "daily_